<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 187 FOR 2 AT LUNCH V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 187 FOR 2 AT LUNCH V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, leading Pakistan by 39 runs in the first innings, were 187 for two wickets in their second innings at lunch on the fourth day of the second and final test match in Colombo on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
